# Defensive yarn config.
#
# This repo is npm-managed (see package-lock.json). Render's build command
# should be `npm install`. If a Render build environment somehow invokes
# `yarn install` instead — and yarn classic (v1) on Render's image throws
# `Package "doctrine-labs-flf-epistack" refers to a non-existing file`
# because yarn v1 has a self-referential resolution bug — these settings
# force yarn to install from the npm registry using the npm-style package
# resolution rules instead of yarn's file-resolver.
#
# If you change package manager, delete this file.

registry "https://registry.npmjs.org"
network-timeout 600000